<p class="sub">Think alone (1 min) → talk in your group (3 min) → share with the class (1 min)</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card round" style="--c:var(--teal)"><span class="rt">Round 1 · Debate</span><h3>Fixed or floating?</h3><p>Today's system mixes floating and managed rates. Should an MNC prefer a fixed or a floating exchange rate system? Who wins and who loses in each?</p></div>
<div class="card round" style="--c:var(--yellow)"><span class="rt">Round 2 · Decision</span><h3>Which currency to borrow in?</h3><p><i>Hypothetical:</i> an MNC needs funds for a new plant in Vietnam. Should it borrow in USD on the international bond market, or in VND from a local bank? Compare interest cost and currency risk.</p></div>
<div class="card round" style="--c:var(--pink)"><span class="rt">Round 3 · What if?</span><h3>The VND slides 5%</h3><p><i>Hypothetical:</i> the VND depreciates 5% against the USD in one quarter. Which kinds of MNCs benefit and which suffer? Think exporters, importers, and companies with USD debt.</p></div>
</div>
